      "content": "honestly the idea of the er is just really overwhelming right now. i feel like if i go and it's nothing, i'm just wasting everyone's time and money. i've got some leftover ibuprofen and some extra strength tyeinoid in my cabinet, do u think taking a double dose of one of those might help calm the pain down so i can just sleep it off? if i can just get the pain to stop, maybe it'll just go away by morning.",
